{"title":"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/7/8d727efe52a6c07c665d2a7192551aa6aa696e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999 + 999$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333816caec8a2fbab048894c9558f60452619c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2999 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 181~818 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1998 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 999~999 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 198$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"526\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/8/cc87dec22b3435d4a10dee15d9273264b22f9d43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999 + 999 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 1998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"186\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum is approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94b54d17415ae84f7a1bb5bc9cabeb53fc8204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 + 1000 = 2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bde4db1bb6f6f67febe79b25f8788c68bbd8e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$999 &lt; 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" /> so it's slightly less, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/3/b33b768e11385d213f2d0cb7a830b94c7a6ac355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 1998}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"84\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a